    <briefdescription>
<para>Reader for the simple text based instrprof format. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>This format is a simple text format that&apos;s suitable for test data. Records are separated by one or more blank lines, and record fields are separated by new lines.</para>
<para>Each record consists of a function name, a function hash, a number of counters, and then each counter value, in that order. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
